    <guid isPermaLink="false">66c7558cead5fc3792c07b13</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 22 Aug 2024 15:13:15 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>洛玄上昇，玄亦非玄，欢迎大家收听我们的节目！这是第七期节目，邀请的嘉宾是我的朋友怀信，怀信是一位传统文化爱好者，琴棋书画皆有所涉猎，其中对于绘画颇有钻研和一些见解，这期节目他会围绕绘画进行一些对谈分享，如果大家喜欢这个节目，请多多关注、点赞和评论支持🙏</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【添加听友群聊天以及咨询相关事宜可添加助理微信(LXssistant)并备注洛玄听友】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>怀信的一些作品</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhfoHNruq0rewNdvpeNh5jHDepnG.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoNoI6ahCftbZUJYiokW2KyaUp55.jpg"></figure><span></span><h2><strong><span>节目时间线提要</span></strong></h2><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="285">04:45</a> 绘画的欣赏</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><blockquote><span>绘画价值的评估往往存在很多偶然因素</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>绘画的欣赏应该回归个人体验</span></blockquote><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="660">11:00</a> 怀信个人学画经历与认知变化</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><blockquote><span>技术进步带来学习的变化</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>细节技法的挖掘</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>《富春山居图》中线条的异常</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fj2V77JjkTU4J6Y8-HYL4VzGgqXK.png"></figure><span></span><blockquote><span>绘画审美与构思</span></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhlC-RfuTn904UD23ekr-aSNWeWQ.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>画中衣纹特点推测并非由毛笔绘制</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1290">21:30</a> 宋代绘画如何体现格物致知之理法</span></blockquote><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1840">30:40</a> 绘画创作的思考</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><blockquote><span>绘画是一种表达</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>技法与表达之间的平衡，工艺品与艺术品的差异</span></blockquote><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2270">37:50</a> ai浪潮下绘画何去何从</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><blockquote><span>绘画早已失去传媒功能，绘画不是一种生产而是一种生活，艺术向人的回归</span></blockquote>]]></description>
