    <title>关圣帝君到底告诉了陈桂林什么？—从《周处除三害》聊一聊东西方占卜</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65f05c5d6c4561bc21f524cc</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65f05c5d6c4561bc21f524cc</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 12 Mar 2024 13:45:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>洛玄上昇，玄亦非玄，欢迎大家收听我们的节目！第三期节目主要是介绍占卜相关内容，我们会先从《周处除三害》这部电影出发，对于其中陈桂林的原型人物</span><em><span>刘焕荣</span></em><span>的命盘具体时间进行推测并结合大运流年进行解读，再对片中陈桂林向关圣帝君打卦的方法——掷杯筊进行介绍，并结合嘉宾的亲身经历让大家对这种打卦方法有进一步了解。</span></p><span></span><p><span>第二部分会比较概括性的介绍占卜的原则和注意事项，对于东西玄占卜的常见方法的介绍以及优缺点等，在这一部分会为大家介绍六爻、占星骰子、卜卦占星以及塔罗相关的内容。并结合实际的卦例让大家对于几种占卜方法更细致的特点、操作、历史和流派等有大致的了解，希望通过这期节目能够为大家稍微揭开占卜这一个看似比较神秘的领域的一点面纱，希望大家喜欢，欢迎大家订阅我们的播客节目并点赞，如果大家有想听的内容和感兴趣的话题也欢迎在评论区与我们交流！</span></p><span></span><p><span>最后这期节目也会有一个</span><strong><span>占卜相关的福利</span></strong><span>，会在节目的最后进行介绍，欢迎大家加入我们听友群参与福利抽奖。</span></p><span></span><p><span>添加听友群聊天以及咨询相关事宜可添加助理微信(LXssistant)并备注</span><em><strong><span>洛玄听友</span></strong></em><span>即可。</span></p><span></span><p><span>—————————————————————————————————————————————————</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>节目时间线</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>Part 1 &nbsp;原型人物刘焕荣生平相关</span></strong></li><span></span></ul><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="164">02:44</a> 陈桂林原型人物刘焕荣八字命盘及大运解读&nbsp;</span></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtMKlFssqHdo6BEHqBG2v889dAnv.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="464">07:44</a> 刘焕荣星盘解读</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmeO0psW6mQ7l5Q7T9XBa2UOk1-0.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>Part 2 掷杯筊占卜介绍&amp;结合电影解读</span></strong></li><span></span></ul><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="625">10:25</a> 掷杯筊历史，卦意及操作方法介绍</span></blockquote><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="703">11:43</a> &nbsp;嘉宾对于掷杯筊占卜的亲身经历</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>—————————————————————————————————————————————————</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>民间卦辞解读某个版本，供大家参考</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>一、圣圣阴</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>角声三弄，无雪心寒。</span></p><span></span><p><span>劝君休虑，合眷人安。</span></p><span></span><p><span>解：贵人助，事有理，后有迁时，前程得路，喜得平安，到老双全。</span></p><span></span><p><span>断：婚好病安，怀孕生男，行人至。</span></p><span></span><p><span>陈按：宫商角徵羽，角为木音（甲寅），病重占此，虚惊一场。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>二、圣圣阳</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>亢宿金龙，行子丑宫。</span></p><span></span><p><span>藏身在未，急避他乡。</span></p><span></span><p><span>解：缺月团圆，枯木再生，慢性且步，诸事难成。</span></p><span></span><p><span>断：病安行人至，财有，婚不成。</span></p><span></span><p><span>陈按：子丑宫乃潜龙勿用，未为阴极。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>三、阴阴阳</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>低头偷看，暗想佳人。</span></p><span></span><p><span>任君巧舌，恐未成亲。</span></p><span></span><p><span>解：往事劳心，求财问事，家败人亡，食无求饱，居无求安。</span></p><span></span><p><span>断：讼吉财无，婚难，人未至。</span></p><span></span><p><span>陈按：婚姻卦。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>四、阴阳阴</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>房生瑞草，孕妇目喜。</span></p><span></span><p><span>合眷皆庆，麒麟是子。</span></p><span></span><p><span>解：牛朗织女难会佳期，好事难得，不可向前。</span></p><span></span><p><span>断：讼吉，病安，怀孕生男，人未至。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>五、阳阴阴</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>心事未分明，双恐被鬼惊。</span></p><span></span><p><span>细思犹难解，暗路失明灯。</span></p><span></span><p><span>解：人若好善，恶事莫为，虽有优疑，贵人自至。</span></p><span></span><p><span>断：求财无，婚不遂，怀孕生女。</span></p><span></span><p><span>陈按：家宅坟山不吉，有灾。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>六、阴圣圣</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>昆头相似，不寒不温。</span></p><span></span><p><span>行人觅宿，即须寻衬。</span></p><span></span><p><span>解：问事迟疑，眼前未遂，日后迁时云开见的依旧生辉。</span></p><span></span><p><span>断：财有，人至，婚不成，病凶。</span></p><span></span><p><span>陈按：尾有缘，头无缘，如神见现场。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>七、阳圣圣</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>箕帚是扫泥，一朝便得贵人提。</span></p><span></span><p><span>解：身闲不闲，求神作福，老少平安，失物难寻。</span></p><span></span><p><span>断：财有，婚好，病安，事不成。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>八、阳阳阴</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>头秤不公平，到底亦相争。</span></p><span></span><p><span>解：凡事摘未在手，女儿何得久免伤和气，且宜守退。</span></p><span></span><p><span>断：财无，物失，事凶，婚不成。</span></p><span></span><p><span>陈按：生意贸易斗讼卦。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>九、阴阳阳</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>牛饱眠，牧童前。</span></p><span></span><p><span>人知我，愉如心。</span></p><span></span><p><span>解：金锂化龙，直上青天，顺水行舟，龙蛇有变。</span></p><span></span><p><span>断：财无，婚不成，行人至，病凶。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>十、阴阴阴</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>女子良媒，通音便成。</span></p><span></span><p><span>相谈未了，好事天来。</span></p><span></span><p><span>解：哑子梦，口难言，病难好，物难寻，暗穿针，要小心。</span></p><span></span><p><span>断：孕女，财无，婚好，物不见。</span></p><span></span><p><span>陈按：阴阳差错。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>十一、圣阴圣</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>虚心拜神，岂不灵验。</span></p><span></span><p><span>所求遂意，颇知女情。</span></p><span></span><p><span>解：皎月被云遮，云开依旧，光前世姻缘，万物生来。</span></p><span></span><p><span>断：讼吉，财无，行人至，婚不好。</span></p><span></span><p><span>陈按：神人沟通，三家。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>十二、阴圣阴</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>危途千里外，山水两悠悠。</span></p><span></span><p><span>解：他要进前，事有难言，梦中得宝，醒后全无。</span></p><span></span><p><span>断：讼凶，财无，行人至，婚不成。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>十三、阳阴阳</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>室象难成，四序和平。</span></p><span></span><p><span>若要心头快，青云足下生。</span></p><span></span><p><span>解：好花洌，子里开，不遇春，且宜退，不可进，宜守旧，免灾。</span></p><span></span><p><span>断：孕女，行人至，财有，婚不成。</span></p><span></span><p><span>陈按：阴阳差错，婚卦。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>十四、阴阳阳</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>壁月卦云，鱼上急滩。</span></p><span></span><p><span>欲捉鱼月，上下两难。</span></p><span></span><p><span>解：龙门未开，功名守得，好事未来，东风不湎，又遇南阴。</span></p><span></span><p><span>断：病吉，财无，行人至，婚不成。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>十五、圣阳阳</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>奎星报与否，汝且听知闻。</span></p><span></span><p><span>上看十一口，下看十八分。</span></p><span></span><p><span>解：勤读书功名遂，经纪得财，六甲生男。缘份终成，吉利。</span></p><span></span><p><span>断：行人至，病安，财无，失物见。</span></p><span></span><p><span>陈按：口舌（三、四含也）吉兆。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>十六、圣阴阳</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>娄氏头戴米，身穿子路衣。</span></p><span></span><p><span>人人皆道是，我且又堪疑。</span></p><span></span><p><span>解：人作事，自无私，贵人遇，前程有份，营谋皆通。</span></p><span></span><p><span>断：讼吉，婚好，病安，求财有。</span></p><span></span><p><span>陈按：娄泛指女性，米字分析为八个八方：八卦，一妇求子，得此卦，骤一看其头上的发誉装饰正象八卦。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>十七、阳阴阴</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>胃腹调，睡一宵。</span></p><span></span><p><span>在他动，我无聊。</span></p><span></span><p><span>解：厄事未成，奈心依旧，得宽怀，福禄来，守旧当强。</span></p><span></span><p><span>断：讼吉，病安，财有，行人至。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>十八、圣阳圣</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>昴戴日，炎不多。</span></p><span></span><p><span>去两热，被他磨。</span></p><span></span><p><span>解：凿石得玉，掏沙见金，小船过滩，前程有路，贵人相扶。</span></p><span></span><p><span>断：讼凶，病安，行人至，求财有。</span></p><span></span><p><span>陈按：经爱岁月，终吉。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>十九、圣阳阴</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>毕竟风起，定招客惊。</span></p><span></span><p><span>秋来须冷，惟有月明。</span></p><span></span><p><span>解：人生老，秋风凉，然命好，马毛长，金生水，晚景安。</span></p><span></span><p><span>断：病安，行人未至，财有，讼凶。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>二十、阳阳阳</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>嘴占碧玉，人知吉凶。</span></p><span></span><p><span>劝君退步，恐坠坑中。</span></p><span></span><p><span>解：神龙战野，吉者得难，免殃诸事通，人未至，讼可进。</span></p><span></span><p><span>断：讼吉，病安，财无，行人未至。</span></p><span></span><p><span>陈按：坤、坎龙战于野，其血玄黄，讼上九：亢龙有悔。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>二十一、圣圣圣</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>参宿无凶，君不用疑。</span></p><span></span><p><span>所求称遂，好大家知。</span></p><span></span><p><span>解：好花芳菲，未曾结实，狂风吹着，用力无功，故事相同。</span></p><span></span><p><span>断：讼凶，行人未至，病安，财有。</span></p><span></span><p><span>陈按：参宿无吉句，有人作参宿，元吉，实践检验看占何事，两者多有应验。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>二十二、阳圣阴</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>井泉甘，南风薰。</span></p><span></span><p><span>呼童取，上高峰。</span></p><span></span><p><span>解：作事虎问龙，饶人不可进，不须相问，月女老。</span></p><span></span><p><span>断：讼吉，病安，行人至，财有。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>二十三、阴圣阳</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>鬼崇作殃，事要郑方。</span></p><span></span><p><span>火中走马，四蹄元伤。</span></p><span></span><p><span>解：家和得财，病安，因祸得福，行人归，老得福，少得禄。</span></p><span></span><p><span>断：讼吉，病安，行人至，财有。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>二十四、阳圣阳</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>柳舞风，西又东。</span></p><span></span><p><span>行人笑，作老翁。</span></p><span></span><p><span>解：远望行人，三五相逢，若问前程，贵人相逢，诸事得成。</span></p><span></span><p><span>断：病安，讼凶，财有，行人至。</span></p><span></span><p><span>陈按：诸事大吉，中有风波。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>二十五、阴阴圣</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>晨星灿烂，河汉相通。</span></p><span></span><p><span>牛女相见，泪后西东。</span></p><span></span><p><span>解：江事恼，舟过滩，虽过得，见艰难，病难救，失难寻。</span></p><span></span><p><span>断：讼吉，病凶，财无，人未至。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>二十六、阳阳圣</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>张舍出贤，流传代代。</span></p><span></span><p><span>到头归涧，此事为真。</span></p><span></span><p><span>解：后事迟疑，前人栽果后人收，当时进步，退后难留。</span></p><span></span><p><span>断：孕女，坟山屋宅，梦境。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>二十七、阳阴圣</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>翼飞万里，志在云霄。</span></p><span></span><p><span>风云忽起，身归异漂。</span></p><span></span><p><span>解：喜气欣欣，枯木再生，开花结子，有功之日。</span></p><span></span><p><span>断：讼吉，病安，行人至，求财有。</span></p><span></span><p><span>—————————————————————————————————————————————————</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>Part 3 卜筮的介绍—原则&amp;注意事项</span></strong></li><span></span></ul><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="960">16:00</a> 占卜总原则</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1040">17:20</a> 占卜问卦注意客观性，主体性与客观现象差异案例说明</span></blockquote><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>Part 4 东西方占卜术数介绍及案例分享</span></strong></li><span></span></ul><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1177">19:37</a> 六爻介绍案例分享</span></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fu6w2piFW-dYbwgw3iUq_zUETTXX.png"></figure><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1290">21:30</a> 占星筛子介绍，优缺点等</span></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FouFd6OlYJQDktH9qzkY9eX_KzpJ.png"></figure><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1525">25:25</a> 卜卦占星介绍 ，与占星骰子的差异等</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1595">26:35</a> 塔罗牌历史流派介绍&nbsp;</span></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FswJCp4kVRLPQPghWSZjvucr2Ub9.png"></figure><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1910">31:50</a> 占星骰子寻找失物&amp;职场调动咨询&nbsp;</span></blockquote><span></span><p><em><span>职场调动占星卦</span></em></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnjXnmXEAjEqKCP2w-rkrPCgig4L.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2255">37:35</a> 福利占卜活动介绍&nbsp;</span></p>]]></description>
